{"2872600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Colonies of The Remnant", "steam_appid": 2872600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872600/extras/4d24c40aeebddc3b2e77a2f6a60e66e5.avif?t=1784301320\" width=180 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You don’t just survive. You lead.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world destroyed by a failed cure, survival is no longer enough.<br>Build your own colony, recruit survivors, and take control of their lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decide who works, who fights, and who earns their place in your camp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this new world, the dead are not your only threat.<br>Other survivors want what you have — and they won’t ask twice.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🟠 FOUND AND LEAD YOUR OWN COLONY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with nothing. Build something that lasts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create and develop your own colony in a dangerous open world.<br>Recruit survivors, assign roles, and shape your group based on your decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you build a loyal community — or rule through fear?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your colony, expand your influence, and prove your leadership.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🟡 CAMP LIFE AND CONTROL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your colony lives or dies by your decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assign tasks such as farming, resource gathering, and animal care.<br>Manage hunger, sleep, and psychological states to keep your people functional.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every survivor has a role.<br>Every decision has consequences.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔵 ACTION-FUELED BATTLES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival alone is not enough. You must fight for control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in combat against the undead and rival colonies. <br>Lead assaults, defend your territory, and take over enemy camps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit the survivors you defeat — or eliminate them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🟣 OPEN WORLD AND FREEDOM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a dangerous, living world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roam freely across a large city filled with threats, opportunities, and hidden resources.<br>Follow the story — or create your own path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world reacts to your actions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚫ KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vast 6 km² open world city</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colony building and management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit and control survivors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Task assignment and resource systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunger, sleep, and psychological mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI-driven characters with dynamic behavior</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy colonies to conquer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FPS and TPS gameplay options</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day-night cycle and dynamic weather</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four seasons affecting gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vehicles for exploration and transport</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reputation and trust systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alliances with other colonies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-driven and sandbox gameplay options</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872600/extras/6bf268b3d198d352a235745b3e7e7962.avif?t=1784301320\" width=1455 height=324 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_pa