r territory, and take over enemy camps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit the survivors you defeat — or eliminate them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🟣 OPEN WORLD AND FREEDOM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a dangerous, living world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roam freely across a large city filled with threats, opportunities, and hidden resources.<br>Follow the story — or create your own path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world reacts to your actions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚫ KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vast 6 km² open world city</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colony building and management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit and control survivors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Task assignment and resource systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunger, sleep, and psychological mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI-driven characters with dynamic behavior</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy colonies to conquer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FPS and TPS gameplay options</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day-night cycle and dynamic weather</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four seasons affecting gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vehicles for exploration and transport</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reputation and trust systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alliances with other colonies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-driven and sandbox gameplay options</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872600/extras/6bf268b3d198d352a235745b3e7e7962.avif?t=1784301320\" width=1455 height=324 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "In a post-apocalyptic world build and lead your own colony under the constant threat of the undead.